                      "name":  "explore",
                      "description":  "Read-only codebase locator. Answers where X lives, which files do Y, and what code implements Z, returning absolute paths with a direct answer. Launch several in parallel for broad sweeps and state depth: quick, medium, or very thorough. Triggers: explore, find in codebase, where is, ì½ë ìì¹ íì.",
