                      "name":  "librarian",
                      "description":  "Read-only external research agent for open-source code and official documentation. Use when the answer lives outside this workspace: library internals, remote repository code, upstream issues and releases, usage examples. Every code claim carries a commit-pinned permalink. Triggers: librarian, look up upstream, library internals, ì¤íìì¤ ì¡°ì¬, ê³µì ë¬¸ì íì¸.",
